uality and reduces sleep disturbance. This relationship is well-established in scientific literature and does not require mediation by other variables in the given CLD.', 'aggregate_score': 0.375, 'judge_verdict': 'Partially supported', 'perplexity': 1.376067850533372, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8136113344877486, 'min_prob': 0.02180117614694403, 'token_prob_slope': -0.003922008611347438, 'prob_variance': 0.06875837269548382, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.10500313383009, 'avg_nll': 0.3192300482761032}

