ng and loneliness."}], "aggregate_score": 0.2, "aggregate_verdict": "Not supported"}', 'motivation': 'Smoking (SMQ) does not directly cause Loneliness (UCLS), nor does Loneliness (UCLS) directly cause Smoking (SMQ). There is no established direct causal mechanism linking these variables in either direction. Any observed association between them is likely due to mediating or confounding variables. Therefore, no direct causal relationship exists between Smoking (SMQ) and Loneliness (UCLS) in the CLD.', 'aggregate_score': 0.2, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.2328921401492574, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8653734838070255, 'min_prob': 0.07580344492245718, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0020900990745400454, 'prob_variance': 0.051531833372799235, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.8173602177110707, 'avg_nll': 0.2093627427801985}

